      "text": "Pythonコード & Markdown向け スマートDiffの仕組み",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle"
    },
    {
      "id": "box_legacy",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 110,
      "width": 370,
      "height": 260,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff5f5",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1.5,
      "roughness": 0,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "text_legacy_title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 125,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 25,
      "text": "【従来の文字単位比較 (difflib標準)】",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "text_legacy_py",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 165,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 70,
      "text": "■ Pythonコード:\n  - def calculate_[tot]al_amount():\n  + def calculate_[fin]al_amount():\n  ※ \"_\" や \"al_amount\" が部分一致して\n    単語の途中でブツブツ細切れに！",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "text_legacy_md",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "■ 日本語Markdown:\n  - [今]日は晴天でした\n  + [明]日は大雨でした\n  ※ \"日\" だけが一致扱いになり、\n    \"今日/明日\" という単語が分断される",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "box_smart",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 450,
      "y": 110,
      "width": 370,
      "height": 260,
      "strokeColor": "#2b8a3e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "text_smart_title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 125,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 25,
      "text": "【実装したスマートDiff (トークン単位)】",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "text_smart_py",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 165,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 70,
      "text": "■ Pythonコード:\n  - def [calculate_total_amount]():\n  + def [calculate_final_amount]():\n  ★ 変数名・識別子を丸ごとハイライト！\n    人間がコードを読む感覚と完全一致。",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "text_smart_md",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "■ 日本語Markdown:\n  - [今日]は[晴天]でした\n  + [明日]は[大雨]でした\n  ★ 単語（漢字塊・ひらがな塊）ごとに\n    きれいに色分けされて一目で分かる！",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "box_anchor",
      "type": "rectangle",
